## Dialogue: npc1 (Ardan)
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc1.greeting=Greetings, traveler. I am Ardan, guard of this village.
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc1.intro=More zombies come every night. Will you help me?
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc1.ready=You took care of those zombies? Tell me everything.
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc1.thanks=Thank you for clearing out those zombies. The village is safer because of you.

## Dialogue: npc2 (Mira)
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc2.greeting=Quiet, traveler. I'm Mira, I hunt these woods.
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc2.intro=Skeletons have been shooting at anyone who walks near the forest. Can you thin them out?
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc2.ready=Back already? Did you deal with those skeletons?
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc2.bones_intro=Nice work with those skeletons. Their bones make the best arrow glue. Bring me some?
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc2.bones_ready=That's a fine pile of bones. Hand them over?
mini_rpg.dialogue.npc2.thanks=The forest is quiet again, and my quiver is full. Good hunting, friend.
